From b35bea3d555c8e75c4a3f0c3ea39662e1547064c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vibe <vibe@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:43:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Per-model direction sets: rewrite treatFoliar as
 phase::VegetationMaterialWriter

- New VegetationMaterialWriter (Phase/materials/) ports the old treatFoliar body
  to the phsdata structs; models iterated grouped by DirectionSetLink (stable
  order, output index = indexFunction) and prepareVegetationDirectionSet()
  redoes the direction-set-dependent precomputing only on change
- processVegetationVolumeMaterials() now only allocates the shared foliar
  objects; buildFoliarOpticalPropertyParameters() shared by
  createDatabasesReadingProperties() and the writer
- sphereMap restored as a writer member (built once from fTFoliar.iterationStepPhi)
- Old treatFoliar/computeFoliarFluorescenceMatrices/computeFoliarSpecular and the
  commented treat* loop removed; foliar specular database dropped
- Bug fix: LambertianMaterialWriter::prepareDatabase() uses
  getOutputTempDatabasePath(true)+selfDestruct for prospect-generated DBs
